// 'extends' naming a trait. The module design brief once spelled a module
// conforming to a module trait this way -- 'mod arena extends Region' -- but that
// is a different reading from reuse, and conforming is spelled 'is'. Refused,
// rather than taken as reuse of something that has no names of its own to reuse.

mod arena extends Region;                 //~ ErrorModExtends "with 'is'"
